# What a region asks of him (docs/VISION.md §10.4), through the real keys: walk up
# to somebody who lives here and press use, and they say what is wrong with this
# place in their own words — never a list on the glass. What they ask for is read
# off the region's own state, so it differs by seed and by what has been done.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/region.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --folk=6
coast calm
wait 0.8
await asked 3
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 01-what-is-wrong-here with talking,folk
press pause
wait 0.6
await heard_ask 2
